WEBVTT

1
00:00:06,480 --> 00:00:09,000
I wiped out all of you, so why not?

2
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:22,230
I have something to tell you about what you are doing

3
00:00:23,750 --> 00:00:24,830
Brother Shen An

4
00:00:25,230 --> 00:00:27,550
Tomorrow we will evacuate Shen An with the people downstairs.

5
00:00:27,910 --> 00:00:32,680
Will you let me know if you can bring us to discuss the breakout downstairs tomorrow?

6
00:00:32,840 --> 00:00:36,160
I'm not arguing with you. You also know that our health is getting better every day. That's enough.

7
00:00:36,440 --> 00:00:37,800
You can leave if you want, I won't go

8
00:00:38,620 --> 00:00:45,300
If any of you want to stay with me, I already told you

9
00:00:45,460 --> 00:00:47,140
A woman can’t be in charge of the house. Shen An
